1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,319
Every Habesha mom has a hidden superpower.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,833
My daughter, bring me my bag from the bedroom table.

3
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:19,487
I went in. Not on the table. Under the bed, in the wardrobe... I searched everywhere.

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,588
Mom! It's not here! I can't find it!

5
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:31,766
What?! It's not there?! If I come in there and find it... I'm kicking you!

6
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:39,533
Mom walked in. It didn't take her one second. It was on the bed, right in front of me!

7
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,280
Here it is! What is this?! Where are your eyes?!

8
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:53,940
Another day, Mom was busy making wot. I cleaned the house and came with the trash.

9
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,009
Mom, where should I put the trash?

10
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:01,222
Put it on my head!

11
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:10,178
Habesha moms find everything, and have an answer for everything. For my mom.
